    { "type": "text", "text": "One August afternoon, I sat in my kitchen staring at a glass vase that hadn’t seen daylight since my wedding. My husband and I had just sold our house and we were busy " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g21" },
    { "type": "text", "text": " the beloved home our family had spent 23 years filling up. We had decided on key items for the " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g22" },
    { "type": "text", "text": " we were moving to in town, donated what we could, and rented a place to " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g23" },
    { "type": "text", "text": " our supposedly important objects. That left a house still " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g24" },
    { "type": "text", "text": " with things that, while not particularly " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g25" },
    { "type": "text", "text": ", didn’t belong in a landfill (垃圾填埋场).\n\nI took a picture of the vase and posted it online, for $10. A couple of messages came in, one wanting additional " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g26" },
    { "type": "text", "text": ", another asking for a price cut. As our " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g27" },
    { "type": "text", "text": " day drew near, I settled on a new price ($0) and reposted it. The " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g28" },
    { "type": "text", "text": ": “I hate this vase. Maybe you won’t.” In an instant, a woman raced into my house and left happily with the vase.\n\n" },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g29" },
    { "type": "text", "text": ", I posted more. My daily posts and the " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g30" },
    { "type": "text", "text": " I received became a precious ray of light in the chaos of my house. Each exchange provided a chance to " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g31" },
    { "type": "text", "text": " the landfill and to please another person I might not otherwise have " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g32" },
    { "type": "text", "text": ".\n\nI sit in my apartment today, loving each of the " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g33" },
    { "type": "text", "text": " that share our small space. I take " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g34" },
    { "type": "text", "text": " in knowing that, somewhere nearby, someone is " },
    { "type": "gap", "gapId": "g35" },
    { "type": "text", "text": " something that couldn’t come with us." }
  ],
